{"id":"7f44c09461ec8881","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-topo8-f-space.md","title":"ZFC Topo8 F Space","display":"df-zfc-topo8-f-space — ZFC Topo8 F Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo8-f-space","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo8-f-space"],"display":"df-zfc-topo8-f-space — ZFC Topo8 F Space","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-top2-hausdorff-space.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-top5-continuous-map.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-reals.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo8-f-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo8-f-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo8-f-space — ZFC Topo8 F Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0e251de61cf71058\" href=\"?note=0e251de61cf71058\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-top2-hausdorff-space.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-top2-hausdorff-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"682d2801cf83c784\" href=\"?note=682d2801cf83c784\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-top5-continuous-map.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-top5-continuous-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9ac97ecaeb21258a\" href=\"?note=9ac97ecaeb21258a\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c54af6fc6a780954\" href=\"?note=c54af6fc6a780954\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-reals.md\">../batch02/58-df-reals.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\in V\\land\\tau_{\\mathbb R}=\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb R:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;((x-\\varepsilon,x+\\varepsilon)\\subseteq U)\\}\">\\(X,\\tau,\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\in V\\land\\tau_{\\mathbb R}=\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb R:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;((x-\\varepsilon,x+\\varepsilon)\\subseteq U)\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c54af6fc6a780954\" href=\"?note=c54af6fc6a780954\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-reals.md\">../batch02/58-df-reals.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2HausdorffSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2HausdorffSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0e251de61cf71058\" href=\"?note=0e251de61cf71058\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-top2-hausdorff-space.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-top2-hausdorff-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ContinuousMap}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ContinuousMap}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"682d2801cf83c784\" href=\"?note=682d2801cf83c784\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-top5-continuous-map.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-top5-continuous-map.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"9ac97ecaeb21258a\" href=\"?note=9ac97ecaeb21258a\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8FSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8FSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo8\\text{-}f\\text{-}space}\n\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo8FSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\mathrm{ZfcTop2HausdorffSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad {}\\land\n\\forall F\\subseteq X\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\n\\Bigl(x\\notin F\\land X\\setminus F\\in\\tau\\to\n\\exists h\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ContinuousMap}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R},h)\n\\land h(x)=0\n\\land\\forall y\\in F\\;(h(y)=1)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad {}\\land\n\\forall f\\;\\forall g\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ContinuousMap}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R},f)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ContinuousMap}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R},g)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\{x\\in X\\mid f(x)\\neq0\\}\\cap\\{x\\in X\\mid g(x)\\neq0\\}=\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\n\\exists C\\;\\exists D\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S(X,\\tau,\\{x\\in X\\mid f(x)\\neq0\\},C)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S(X,\\tau,\\{x\\in X\\mid g(x)\\neq0\\},D)\n\\land C\\cap D=\\varnothing\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo8\\text{-}f\\text{-}space}\n\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo8FSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\mathrm{ZfcTop2HausdorffSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad {}\\land\n\\forall F\\subseteq X\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\n\\Bigl(x\\notin F\\land X\\setminus F\\in\\tau\\to\n\\exists h\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ContinuousMap}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R},h)\n\\land h(x)=0\n\\land\\forall y\\in F\\;(h(y)=1)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad {}\\land\n\\forall f\\;\\forall g\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ContinuousMap}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R},f)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ContinuousMap}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R},g)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\{x\\in X\\mid f(x)\\neq0\\}\\cap\\{x\\in X\\mid g(x)\\neq0\\}=\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\n\\exists C\\;\\exists D\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S(X,\\tau,\\{x\\in X\\mid f(x)\\neq0\\},C)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S(X,\\tau,\\{x\\in X\\mid g(x)\\neq0\\},D)\n\\land C\\cap D=\\varnothing\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The first two conjuncts spell out the Tychonoff condition (Hausdorff plus complete regularity).</li>\n<li>The last conjunct is the standard characterization of an <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span>-space by disjoint closures of disjoint cozero sets.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-zfc-top2-hausdorff-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"0e251de61cf71058","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-top2-hausdorff-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-zfc-top5-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"682d2801cf83c784","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-top5-continuous-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ac97ecaeb21258a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-reals.md","status":"resolved","id":"c54af6fc6a780954","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · dep